The charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter[[cite:obs-2924bd2d2a6b74c01dae1010323d48b584984dc2 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]. According to the annex, the ordinary contribution is one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January[[cite:obs-55dbf5b885d5bb9b66add18c5d1c21c8b18bb4ba "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]].